   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div><div><div>Suppose I have<br></div>mySillyQuestion&lt;-c(&quot;avner&quot;, &quot;moshe&quot;, &quot;haim&quot;, &quot;moti&quot;, &quot;tal&quot;, &quot;amit&quot;)<br></div><br></div>I want to get all the names between moshe and tal without using index.<br></div><div><br>I tried subset(mySillyQuestion, select = moshe:tal)<br><br>What is the easiet way to do it? (the hard way is to use dplyr and select() columns after reshape)<br><br></div></div>Thanks,<br><br></div>Avner<br></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "7uQ3nLdlEAAJ",
   "from": "Michael Dorman",
   "author": "c0e822e430c1a5a7",
   "date": "2016-08-07T09:41:03Z",
   "subject": "Re: [Israel RUG] Subsetting character by names",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Here is a way to do it with base R -<div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border:none;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">x = c(&quot;avner&quot;, &quot;moshe&quot;, &quot;haim&quot;, &quot;moti&quot;, &quot;tal&quot;, &quot;amit&quot;)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue\">x\r\n</span>[1] &quot;avner&quot; &quot;moshe&quot; &quot;haim&quot;  &quot;moti&quot;  &quot;tal&quot;   &quot;amit&quot; \r\n<span style=\"color:blue\">x[which(x == &quot;moshe&quot;) : which(x == &quot;tal&quot;)]\r\n</span>[1] &quot;moshe&quot; &quot;haim&quot;  &quot;moti&quot;  &quot;tal&quot;  </pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border:none;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sun, Aug 7, 2016 at 11:33 AM, Avner Kantor <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">avner...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
